#. ここはロッカールームになっているのか…
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "This room is filled with lockers..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>きっと、ボクらの前から、
#. 希望ヶ峰学園にいた生徒達の…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It must have been for the Hope's Peak students who\n"
"came before us...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>つまり、<CLT><CLT 3>“ボクらの先輩達”<CLT><CLT 4>が
#. 使っていたロッカーなんだろうな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The <CLT><CLT 3>class before ours<CLT><CLT 4> must have used these lockers.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>調べれば調べるほど…
#. ますます、意味がわからない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But the more I see, the less sense it makes.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だって、ここのロッカーって…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Because these lockers...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>前から希望ヶ峰学園にいた生徒とかが
#. 使ってた物じゃなかったのか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I mean, they had to belong to the previous students,\n"
"right?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それなのに、そんなロッカーの中に…
#. どうして…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So why am I seeing this...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>あの２人の物が…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Why are there things in the lockers that look like\n"
"they belong to people here?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 葉隠クンの物らしきノート…
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "A notebook that seems like it belongs to Hiro..."
msgstr ""

#. 霧切さんの物らしき手帳…
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"And a pocketbook that seems like it belongs to\n"
"Kyoko..."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. …きっと、何か理由があるはずだ。
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "There has to be some kind of explanation."
msgstr ""

#. とにかく、今は捜査を進めて、
#. それを突き止めるしかない…
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"But if I want to find that out, I have to keep moving\n"
"the investigation forward."
msgstr ""

#. …みんなを信じて。
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "And I have to believe in everyone."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もうわかったよ…
#. そんな気分だ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This has done as much damage to my psyche as it's\n"
"gonna do. I'm over it...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もうわかったよ…
#. そんな気分だ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This has done as much damage to my psyche as it's\n"
"gonna do. I'm over it...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>このロッカーは開きそうだぞ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0017 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I wonder if I can open this locker...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>「ガチャ、ガチャ…」
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0018 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>*Rattle rattle*\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 23>“Lạch cạch lạch cạch!”\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>…鍵が掛かってるのか。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Nope. Locked.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>取っ手の上にカードリーダーがある…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0020 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's a card reader installed on the door.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>おそらく、このカードリーダーが
#. ロッカーの鍵なんだろうけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0021 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>That must be how you get the locker open.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>これって、似てるよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0022 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>After all...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>学校エリア２階の…更衣室のカードリーダーと…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0023 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...it's pretty similar to the card readers for the\n"
"locker rooms on the 2nd floor of the school.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>確か、あっちのカードリーダーは、
#. 電子生徒手帳に対応していたはずだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0024 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And you have to use your e-Handbook to open those up.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>じゃあ、このロッカーも…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0025 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So does that mean...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. よし、試してみよう。
msgctxt "0026 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Well, let's just give it a try."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクは自分の電子生徒手帳を取り出すと、
#. それをカードリーダーにかざしてみた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0027 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I took out my handbook and ran it across the card\n"
"reader.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>すると…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0028 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And then...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Và rồi...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 23>「ブブー！」
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0029 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Bzzt!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 駄目か…
msgctxt "0030 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "No luck..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…本人の電子生徒手帳にしか対応してないのかも。
#. じゃあ、ボクらの誰にも開けられないって事か。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0031 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Maybe only the locker's owner can open it. Which means\n"
"none of us can do it...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 待てよ。でも…
msgctxt "0032 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Wait, but...?"
msgstr ""

#. 学園長の個室の隠し部屋で見つけた、
#. この緊急用の電子生徒手帳ならどうだ？
msgctxt "0033 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"What about that emergency handbook I found in the\n"
"headmaster's hidden room?"
msgstr ""

#. よし、もう１度試してみよう…！
msgctxt "0034 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Okay, let's give it one more try...!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>緊急用の電子生徒手帳を、
#. カードリーダーにかざしてみると…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0035 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I took the emergency handbook and ran that across the\n"
"card reader, and...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>「ピピ…」
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0036 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>*Beep*\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>やった！　思った通りだ。開いたぞ！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0037 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Alright! Just what I was hoping for!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>開いたみたいだな。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0038 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like the locker opened...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…よし、さっそく中を確認してみよう。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0039 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Now let's see what we've got inside.\n"
"<CLT>"
