#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0100 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Nope. Locked.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>取っ手の上にカードリーダーがある…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0101 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's a card reader installed on the door.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>おそらく、このカードリーダーが
#. ロッカーの鍵なんだろうけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0102 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>That must be how you get the locker open.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

